data: {"id": "feac45fc6e1d4c07-thinking-parallel_evidence-983", "run_id": "feac45fc6e1d4c07", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "无法通过临时 Pod 验证 hostPath 路径，这是预期的（MCP 权限限制）。但这并不影响从 describe 事件得出的结论。\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份**：`aiops-case-v06/workload`，UID `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`，调度到 `node2`，Container: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`。\n\n2. **Prometheus Metrics 事实**：\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1` → Pod 当前处于 Pending 阶段。\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` → 等待原因确认为 ContainerCreating。\n   - `kube_pod_container_sta", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789131437306, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

